+   `harness/.merge.lock`, which the gate holds. A scheduler commit landing
+   between the gate's `rebaseOntoMain` and its final `merge --ff-only` makes
+   the merge refuse and costs the task an attempt. Suggestion for the planner:
+   have `commitHarnessState` take the merge lock, or have `finalizeMerge`
